        "@value": "Introducing Art Club IN-PERSON workshops! Registration for in-person Art Club is now live! We can’t wait to make art with you! Click the button at the top of this page to register! Swallowing Clouds presents: Art Club! A series of all ages welcome art-making sessions. Art Club focuses on individual…"
