    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Join our FREE in-library arts program! College / Shaw Library: PA Day - Feb 13: 2:00-4:00pm Afterschool - March 10: 4:00-5:30pm For kids aged 6 to 8! Together, we\\'ll use improv, music, storytelling, arts &amp; crafts, and movement to create our own work of creative-movement theatre. Working with professional dancers, musicians and authors, workshop participants&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
